 "_comment": "Carry-12's cells end to end on CPU at toy size, 27 Oct 2026 (tests/test_carry12_cells_e2e.py with C12_TOY_SEEDS=1,2,3; WSL, mtstudio CPU build of paperkiln 437db1f2 plus this commit's Python, ember ec3201b CPU). Every machine file's pretraining spec and post command with the VM's paths mapped to the toy's; toy changes: d 64, 2 or 4 layers, a 700-token BPE vocabulary, 4 pretraining and 3 SFT steps, 2,048 tokens per step (TINY_CHAT_SFT_TOKENS_PER_STEP), 16 panel windows (TINY_CHAT_PANEL_WINDOWS), Carry-5 every 26th item (40), Carry-12 every 110th (14). The toy models are at chance, so every registered contrast reads FLOOR: the gate path is what is exercised.",
